4
00:03:22,050 --> 00:03:25,200
いつだって全身全霊遊び倒せ！
Always give it your all and play to the max!

5
00:03:25,500 --> 00:03:29,000
もっと もっと 楽しめよ乙女
Have even more fun, oh maiden!

6
00:03:29,300 --> 00:03:32,200
みんなに気付かれないように
So that nobody notices you...

7
00:03:32,400 --> 00:03:37,500
いざ、ゆけ！ ひもうとライフ
Now go! The Himouto life!

8
00:03:41,100 --> 00:03:44,000
お気にのフードかぶり
With my favorite hoodie on...

9
00:03:44,100 --> 00:03:47,500
今日も今日とてゴロゴロして
Lazing around today as usual,

10
00:03:47,800 --> 00:03:51,000
大好物のポテチを手に
With my favorite potato chips in hand,

11
00:03:51,100 --> 00:03:54,500
パソコンとにらめっこしよう
Staring down the computer screen.

12
00:03:55,200 --> 00:03:58,000
立てば芍薬座れば牡丹
A peony when standing, a tree peony when sitting,

13
00:03:58,500 --> 00:04:01,500
歩く姿は百合の花
And a lily when walking,

14
00:04:01,800 --> 00:04:05,000
誰もが羨む完璧JK
The flawless high school girl everyone envies!

15
00:04:05,100 --> 00:04:08,500
ほら玄関くぐったら変身だ！
Now, step through the front door and transform!

16
00:04:08,900 --> 00:04:12,500
さぁグータラしよう
Time to go slacking off!

17
00:04:15,800 --> 00:04:19,000
ずっと ずっと ゲームは友達
Always, always, games are my friends.

18
00:04:19,500 --> 00:04:22,500
お兄ちゃんは厳しいけど
Big brother can be strict, but...

19
00:04:22,800 --> 00:04:27,000
きっと きっと 許してくれちゃうの
I'm sure he'll forgive me every time.

20
00:04:27,300 --> 00:04:31,500
ワガママ放題は
All my selfishness...

21
00:04:31,800 --> 00:04:37,000
U・M・R！U・M・R！ UMAじゃないよ う・ま・る！
U-M-R! U-M-R! It's not a UMA, it's Umar!

22
00:04:39,100 --> 00:04:41,800
外では猫をかぶり
Putting on a sweet face outside,

23
00:04:42,000 --> 00:04:44,800
今日も明日も演じるのです
Playing the part today and tomorrow.

24
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:47,800
大好評の笑顔を武器に
Using my acclaimed smile as a weapon,

25
00:04:48,000 --> 00:04:51,200
トモダチにバレないように
So that my friends won't find out...

26
00:04:51,800 --> 00:04:55,000
立てば2頭身 座ればまんまる
Two heads tall when standing, round as a ball when sitting,

27
00:04:55,200 --> 00:04:59,500
歩く姿はちんちくりん
Walking like a tiny little thing!

28
00:05:00,008 --> 00:05:02,358
誰でも癒せる愛嬌マスコット さぁ限界超えるまでぱーりぃないっ！
Anyone's healing, adorable mascot! Come on, party until we break our limits!

29
00:05:03,458 --> 00:05:06,858
宴の始まりだぁ いよいよ今宵もイッツしょ〜たいむっ！
The banquet begins! It's finally showtime tonight!

30
00:05:10,008 --> 00:05:13,458
U・M・R！U・M・R！ UMAじゃないよ う・ま・る！
U.M.R.! U.M.R.! I'm not a UMA, I'm Umaru!

31
00:05:26,558 --> 00:05:30,208
可憐で優雅な女の子演じてみても
Even if I try to act like a lovely and graceful girl,

32
00:05:30,958 --> 00:05:37,458
お兄ちゃんだけは騙せない 嫌われたくないもん
I can't fool my big brother alone, I don't want to be disliked!

33
00:05:37,808 --> 00:05:43,058
素直に言えない「ありがとう」
I can't honestly say "thank you."

34
00:05:45,008 --> 00:05:47,358
態度で示そう
Let's show it through our actions!

35
00:05:48,058 --> 00:05:54,408
だぁ！前言撤回！あぁもーイイじゃん！ お兄ちゃんなんて知らないっ！
Ah, retraction! Oh whatever, it's fine! I don't care about big bro at all!

36
00:05:55,708 --> 00:05:57,208
なんつって！
Just kidding!

37
00:06:00,258 --> 00:06:07,458
一心同体2人でひとつ だって だって それが兄妹でしょ？ 一蓮托生2人きりの運命共同体
Body and soul as two in one! Because, because, that's what siblings are! Sharing the same fate, just the two of us, bound by destiny!

38
00:06:09,908 --> 00:06:13,208
今日だって 自由奔放笑い飛ばせ！
Today too, laugh away freely and boldly!

39
00:06:13,458 --> 00:06:19,458
もっと もっと 楽しんだモン勝ち 天真爛漫スマイルで ぎゅっと ぎゅっと 心をつかんじゃうの
More and more, those who have fun win! With an innocent smile, grabbing your heart tight and close!

40
00:06:21,058 --> 00:06:26,458
やりたい放題は信頼の裏返し？
Doing whatever I want is a sign of trust?

41
00:06:29,858 --> 00:06:36,458
U・M・R！U・M・R！ UMAじゃないよ う・ま・る！
U.M.R.! U.M.R.! I'm not a UMA, I'm Umaru!

42
00:06:36,858 --> 00:06:41,258
はい、おしまいっ！
And that's the wrap!

43
